    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>YOU ARE THE FINAL BOSS.</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Arena roguelike inspired by\u00a0<strong>Brotato</strong>\u00a0and\u00a0<strong>The Binding of Isaac</strong>\u00a0where <strong>you are the Final Boss</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Pick your Dungeon Boss from a huge, unique roster</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Quick and Addictive Runs</strong>\u00a0(&lt;30 minutes)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Craft your build from a wide variety of creative and innovative mechanics:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Equip boss attack patterns, summon minions, swing physics-based chain spikeballs, and kick wrecking balls (and play soccer with your minions or co-op partners!). Wield guns, grow plant minions with a watering can, transform enemies into sheep or golden statues (or both?), mine ore, deploy turrets.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Wild Theorycrafting &amp; Emergent Gameplay</strong>:\u00a0Discover unique synergies</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Break the Game</strong>: Push your <strong>Amount</strong> or <strong>Size</strong> stats to absurd levels and watch the screen explode in chaos! Use the <strong>Cheater</strong> Item to stack unique items multiple times</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Play as a <strong>Giant Worm Boss, Spider Queen, Seductive Succubus</strong> and more</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Wave-Based Carnage: Survive increasingly intense raids of Noobs <strong>(+Endless Mode)</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Level Up and Shop:\u00a0Collect souls to level up and buy powerful upgrades </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Unlock tons of content and challenges</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Cute and Badass artstyle,\u00a0<strong>Banger OST</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Parody RPG Universe, meta humor and funny cutscenes</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>(Twitch Streamer Mode</strong>: noobs takes usernames and messages from chat)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Singleplayer and multiplayer</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>4 players Local Co-op</strong> (+ Steam Remote Play Together)</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>NOOBS ARE COMING!</strong> <strong>Show them who's the boss</strong></h2>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>YOU ARE THE FINAL BOSS.</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Arena roguelike inspired by\u00a0<strong>Brotato</strong>\u00a0and\u00a0<strong>The Binding of Isaac</strong>\u00a0where <strong>you are the Final Boss</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Pick your Dungeon Boss from a huge, unique roster</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Quick and Addictive Runs</strong>\u00a0(&lt;30 minutes)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Craft your build from a wide variety of creative and innovative mechanics:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Equip boss attack patterns, summon minions, swing physics-based chain spikeballs, and kick wrecking balls (and play soccer with your minions or co-op partners!). Wield guns, grow plant minions with a watering can, transform enemies into sheep or golden statues (or both?), mine ore, deploy turrets.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Wild Theorycrafting &amp; Emergent Gameplay</strong>:\u00a0Discover unique synergies</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Break the Game</strong>: Push your <strong>Amount</strong> or <strong>Size</strong> stats to absurd levels and watch the screen explode in chaos! Use the <strong>Cheater</strong> Item to stack unique items multiple times</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Play as a <strong>Giant Worm Boss, Spider Queen, Seductive Succubus</strong> and more</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Wave-Based Carnage: Survive increasingly intense raids of Noobs <strong>(+Endless Mode)</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Level Up and Shop:\u00a0Collect souls to level up and buy powerful upgrades </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Unlock tons of content and challenges</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Cute and Badass artstyle,\u00a0<strong>Banger OST</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Parody RPG Universe, meta humor and funny cutscenes</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>(Twitch Streamer Mode</strong>: noobs takes usernames and messages from chat)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Singleplayer and multiplayer</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>4 players Local Co-op</strong> (+ Steam Remote Play Together)</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>NOOBS ARE COMING!</strong> <strong>Show them who's the boss</strong></h2>",
